es not exist)\">Team 22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">Team 23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">Team 24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">Team 25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Team_Mathematics_Contest\" title=\"CEMC Canadian Team Mathematics Contest\">CEMC Canadian Team Mathematics Contest</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017173834\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 153/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4031/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 212/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3933/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.412      1 Template:CEMC_CTMC_box\n100.00%    8.412      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35717:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017173834 and revision id 278334. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}